      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785715200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LAYER 1 \u2014 TOKEN BUCKET\n(per API key)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LAYER 1 \u2014 TOKEN BUCKET\n(per API key)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_body0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32,
      "y": 158,
      "width": 241,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785715200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redis: token count + last-refill\ntimestamp per key.\n\nRefill computed lazily at\nrequest time:\ntokens = min(cap, tokens +\nelapsed \u00d7 rate)\n\nrate: 100/s, burst cap: 500 (5s)\n\nRead-compute-write = 1 atomic\nRedis Lua script",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis: token count + last-refill\ntimestamp per key.\n\nRefill computed lazily at\nrequest time:\ntokens = min(cap, tokens +\nelapsed \u00d7 rate)\n\nrate: 100/s, burst cap: 500 (5s)\n\nRead-compute-write = 1 atomic\nRedis Lua script",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_box1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 310,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 265,
