    {
      "id": "e_footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 384,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785715200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The tradeoff none of these four remove: every request now costs a Redis round trip before it's allowed to run.\nWhen Redis itself is unreachable, Stripe fails open \u2014 lets requests through unchecked rather than reject everyone\nduring a Redis blip. Measured at roughly 0.01% of requests: a bet that Redis's own uptime beats an outage where\nthe safety net takes down what it was protecting.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The tradeoff none of these four remove: every request now costs a Redis round trip before it's allowed to run.\nWhen Redis itself is unreachable, Stripe fails open \u2014 lets requests through unchecked rather than reject everyone\nduring a Redis blip. Measured at roughly 0.01% of requests: a bet that Redis's own uptime beats an outage where\nthe safety net takes down what it was protecting.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
